  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that multimodal models with multiprofile, imagenet_vit_l image encoder, avgpool aggregation, and weighted fusion (e.g., config_025) achieve the highest accuracy so far (0.6352). This experiment tests replacing pca_n2000 with scvi_n200 RNA encoder while keeping other parameters the same, isolating the impact of RNA encoder choice. This clarifies whether a more sophisticated encoder (scvi_n200) can further improve performance, balancing exploration of key design choices with exploitation of the current top-performing setup."
